\title{M1 · Generalize the validated shape work}
\taxon{Milestone}
\meta{id}{M1}
\meta{origin}{design/08-roadmap.md}
\meta{status}{planned}
\tag{milestone}

\p{Package the arity and nerve results into the general reusable theory (\ref{at-kr-0001}/2/5/8/9), complete the root presentations needed by the public interface, and implement validated shape syntax/rendering. Add a shape family only when a scheduled client needs it. Expand the forest exporter and retrieval against the now nonempty environment.}
\p{\strong{Exit:} the named shape/arity/core tests required for \ref{ms-0003} are proved. Ω, Θ_n, cubes, and geometric presentations have their own later exits and do not block this one. \strong{Freeze:} those adopted shapes and formats whose presentation proofs have passed.}
